  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* chore: update dependencies to latest versions by @BlackOrder in https://github.com/byawitz/ggh/pull/14\r\n* Adding dependabot config by @elibyy in https://github.com/byawitz/ggh/pull/16\r\n* fix: correct variable assignment for SSH port in command args by @BlackOrder in https://github.com/byawitz/ggh/pull/17\r\n* Dependabot file location was wrong by @elibyy in https://github.com/byawitz/ggh/pull/26\r\n* tab characters brakes ssh config parse by @halacs in https://github.com/byawitz/ggh/pull/22\r\n* chore(deps): bump all deps by @gghostman in https://github.com/byawitz/ggh/pull/54\r\n* Added memoriom tribute for @byawitz by @MordiSacks in https://github.com/byawitz/ggh/pull/40\r\n* Updating UI to use full screen by @BlackOrder in https://github.com/byawitz/ggh/pull/29\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @BlackOrder made their first contribution in https://github.com/byawitz/ggh/pull/14\r\n* @halacs made their first contribution in https://github.com/byawitz/ggh/pull/22\r\n* @gghostman made their first contribution in https://github.com/byawitz/ggh/pull/54\r\n* @MordiSacks made their first contribution in https://github.com/byawitz/ggh/pull/40\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/byawitz/ggh/compare/v0.1.4...v0.1.5",
